---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { Icon } from 'astro-icon/components';

const title = "Melanoma | Beating Skin Cancer";
const description = "Melanoma is the most dangerous form of skin cancer but highly curable when caught early. Learn the warning signs, risk factors, and treatment options here.";
---

<Layout title={title} description={description}>
<div class="min-h-screen bg-ivory">
      <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-navy to-slate py-20 pt-32">
        <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
          <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-serif text-white mb-4">Melanoma</h1>
          <p class="text-xl text-white/80">The most serious type of skin cancer</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16">
        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-lg p-8 mb-8">
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-serif text-navy mb-4">What is Melanoma?</h2>
          <p class="text-slate/80 text-lg leading-relaxed mb-6">
            Melanoma is the most dangerous form of skin cancer. It develops in melanocytes, the cells that produce melanin (the pigment that gives skin its color). While less common than basal cell and squamous cell carcinomas, melanoma is more likely to spread to other parts of the body if not caught early.
          </p>
          <p class="text-slate/80 text-lg leading-relaxed">
            Early detection is crucial. When found and treated early, melanoma has a very high cure rate.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-navy to-slate rounded-2xl shadow-lg p-8 text-center mb-8">
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-serif text-white mb-4">Need More Information?</h3>
          <p class="text-white/80 mb-6">Ask questions and get clear, trusted answers — instantly</p>
          <a
            href="https://chatgpt.com/g/g-69045e9a6ad8819192dbd404ede6db6d-beating-skin-cancer-navigator"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-teal text-white px-8 py-3 rounded-full hover:bg-teal/90 transition-all shadow-md hover:shadow-lg font-medium"
          >
            Chat with the Navigator
          </a>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-lg p-8 mb-8">
          <h2 class="text-3xl font-serif text-navy mb-6">Key Topics</h2>
          <p class="text-slate/80 mb-6">
            Explore these essential topics to better understand your melanoma diagnosis and treatment options:
          </p>
          <div class="space-y-3">
            <a href="/melanoma/what-to-expect-after-diagnosis"
              class="block p-4 bg-sky/5 hover:bg-sky/10 rounded-lg transition-colors border border-teal/10 hover:border-teal/30"
            >
              <div class="font-semibold text-teal mb-1">What to Expect After a Melanoma Diagnosis</div>
              <div class="text-sm text-slate/70">Learn about the next steps, timeline, and what happens after diagnosis</div>
            </a>
            <a
              href="https://chatgpt.com/g/g-69045e9a6ad8819192dbd404ede6db6d-beating-skin-cancer-navigator"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="block p-4 bg-sky/5 hover:bg-sky/10 rounded-lg transition-colors border border-teal/10 hover:border-teal/30"
            >
              <div class="font-semibold text-teal mb-1">Understanding Your Melanoma Pathology Report</div>
              <div class="text-sm text-slate/70">Decode the medical terms and numbers in your pathology results</div>
            </a>
            <a
              href="https://chatgpt.com/g/g-69045e9a6ad8819192dbd404ede6db6d-beating-skin-cancer-navigator"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="block p-4 bg-sky/5 hover:bg-sky/10 rounded-lg transition-colors border border-teal/10 hover:border-teal/30"
            >
              <div class="font-semibold text-teal mb-1">Breslow Depth Explained: How "Thickness" Affects Prognosis</div>
              <div class="text-sm text-slate/70">Why melanoma thickness is one of the most important factors</div>
            </a>
            <a href="/melanoma/sentinel-lymph-node-biopsy"
              class="block p-4 bg-sky/5 hover:bg-sky/10 rounded-lg transition-colors border border-teal/10 hover:border-teal/30"
            >
              <div class="font-semibold text-teal mb-1">Sentinel Lymph Node Biopsy: What It Means for Melanoma</div>
              <div class="text-sm text-slate/70">Understanding when and why this procedure is recommended</div>
            </a>
            <a href="/melanoma/melanoma-stage-meaning"
              class="block p-4 bg-sky/5 hover:bg-sky/10 rounded-lg transition-colors border border-teal/10 hover:border-teal/30"
            >
              <div class="font-semibold text-teal mb-1">What Does My Melanoma Stage Mean?</div>
              <div class="text-sm text-slate/70">Plain-language explanation of melanoma staging from 0 to IV</div>
            </a>
            <a href="/melanoma/melanoma-treatment-options"
              class="block p-4 bg-sky/5 hover:bg-sky/10 rounded-lg transition-colors border border-teal/10 hover:border-teal/30"
            >
              <div class="font-semibold text-teal mb-1">Melanoma Treatment Options by Stage</div>
              <div class="text-sm text-slate/70">How treatment plans differ based on your specific stage</div>
            </a>
            <a
              href="https://chatgpt.com/g/g-69045e9a6ad8819192dbd404ede6db6d-beating-skin-cancer-navigator"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="block p-4 bg-sky/5 hover:bg-sky/10 rounded-lg transition-colors border border-teal/10 hover:border-teal/30"
            >
              <div class="font-semibold text-teal mb-1">How to Find the Right Melanoma Specialist Near You</div>
              <div class="text-sm text-slate/70">Tips for locating experienced melanoma doctors and treatment centers</div>
            </a>
            <a
              href="hhttps://chatgpt.com/g/g-69045e9a6ad8819192dbd404ede6db6d-beating-skin-cancer-navigator"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="block p-4 bg-sky/5 hover:bg-sky/10 rounded-lg transition-colors border border-teal/10 hover:border-teal/30"
            >
              <div class="font-semibold text-teal mb-1">Melanoma Clinical Trials: Should You Consider One?</div>
              <div class="text-sm text-slate/70">What clinical trials are, who they're for, and how to find them</div>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-coral/5 rounded-2xl shadow-lg p-8 mb-8">
          <div class="flex items-start gap-4 mb-6">
            <Icon name="lucide:alert-triangle" class="text-coral flex-shrink-0 mt-1" size={32} />
            <div>
              <h2 class="text-3xl font-serif text-navy mb-4">Warning Signs: The ABCDEs of Melanoma</h2>
              <div class="space-y-4">
                <div>
                  <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-navy mb-2">A - Asymmetry</h3>
                  <p class="text-slate/80">One half of the mole doesn't match the other half</p>
                </div>
                <div>
                  <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-navy mb-2">B - Border</h3>
                  <p class="text-slate/80">Edges are irregular, ragged, notched, or blurred</p>
                </div>
                <div>
                  <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-navy mb-2">C - Color</h3>
                  <p class="text-slate/80">Color is not uniform and may include shades of brown, black, pink, red, white, or blue</p>
                </div>
                <div>
                  <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-navy mb-2">D - Diameter</h3>
                  <p class="text-slate/80">Spot is larger than 6mm (about the size of a pencil eraser)</p>
                </div>
                <div>
                  <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-navy mb-2">E - Evolving</h3>
                  <p class="text-slate/80">The mole is changing in size, shape, or color</p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 mb-8">
          <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-lg p-8">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
              <Icon name="lucide:eye" class="text-teal" size={28} />
              <h2 class="text-2xl font-serif text-navy">Risk Factors</h2>
            </div>
            <ul class="space-y-3 text-slate/80">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-teal mt-1">•</span>
                <span>Fair skin, light hair, and light eyes</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-teal mt-1">•</span>
                <span>History of sunburns, especially in childhood</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-teal mt-1">•</span>
                <span>Many moles or atypical moles</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-teal mt-1">•</span>
                <span>Family history of melanoma</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-teal mt-1">•</span>
                <span>Weakened immune system</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-teal mt-1">•</span>
                <span>Excessive UV exposure from sun or tanning beds</span>
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-lg p-8">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
              <Icon name="lucide:shield" class="text-teal" size={28} />
              <h2 class="text-2xl font-serif text-navy">Prevention</h2>
            </div>
            <ul class="space-y-3 text-slate/80">
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-teal mt-1">•</span>
                <span>Use broad-spectrum SPF 30+ sunscreen daily</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-teal mt-1">•</span>
                <span>Seek shade during peak sun hours (10am-4pm)</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-teal mt-1">•</span>
                <span>Wear protective clothing and wide-brimmed hats</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-teal mt-1">•</span>
                <span>Avoid tanning beds completely</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-teal mt-1">•</span>
                <span>Perform monthly self-examinations</span>
              </li>
              <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
                <span class="text-teal mt-1">•</span>
                <span>Get annual skin checks by a dermatologist</span>
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-teal/5 rounded-2xl shadow-lg p-8">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
            <Icon name="lucide:activity" class="text-teal" size={28} />
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-serif text-navy">Treatment Options</h2>
          </div>
          <p class="text-slate/80 mb-4">
            Treatment depends on the stage and location of the melanoma. Options may include:
          </p>
          <ul class="space-y-3 text-slate/80">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="text-teal mt-1">•</span>
              <span><strong>Surgical excision:</strong> Removing the melanoma and some surrounding tissue</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="text-teal mt-1">•</span>
              <span><strong>Immunotherapy:</strong> Helping your immune system fight the cancer</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="text-teal mt-1">•</span>
              <span><strong>Targeted therapy:</strong> Drugs that target specific gene mutations</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-2">
              <span class="text-teal mt-1">•</span>
              <span><strong>Radiation therapy:</strong> Using high-energy rays to kill cancer cells</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-12 bg-gradient-to-br from-navy to-slate rounded-2xl shadow-lg p-8 text-center">
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-serif text-white mb-4">Need More Information?</h3>
          <p class="text-white/80 mb-6">Chat with our AI guide for personalized information about melanoma.</p>
          <a
            href="https://chatgpt.com/g/g-69045e9a6ad8819192dbd404ede6db6d-beating-skin-cancer-navigator"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-teal text-white px-8 py-3 rounded-full hover:bg-teal/90 transition-all shadow-md hover:shadow-lg font-medium"
          >
            Chat with the Navigator
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
</Layout>
